{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14811","headline":"同柳侍郎题侯钊侍郎新昌里 · 卢纶","name":"同柳侍郎题侯钊侍郎新昌里","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清源君子居，左右尽图书。\n三迳春自足，一飘欢有余。\n庭莎成野席，阑药是家蔬。\n幽显岂殊迹，昔贤徒病诸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14811.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14811","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}